## Carried over from prior work by the same author

Parts of `packages/core` are carried over from zkasuran/overhear (MiniMax Week, 2026-08):
the JSON extraction helper, the four-format sheet and the prompt design. Same author, no third-party
grant involved. Each ported file names this in a header comment.

## Third-party components (not redistributed; used under their own terms)

Runtime dependencies, each used under its own licence as resolved in package-lock.json and verified by
`scripts/check-licences.mjs`:

- `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` and `zod`, `zod-to-json-schema`
- `hono`, `@hono/node-server`
- `@aws-sdk/*` (AWS SDK for JavaScript v3)

Development-only tooling (TypeScript, ESLint, Prettier, Vitest, fast-check and their dependencies) is
not shipped in any published artifact.

`ffmpeg` and `ffprobe` are invoked as external system binaries at runtime. They are not bundled or
redistributed with this software; the operator provides them.

Amazon Bedrock, Amazon Polly, Amazon Nova, Amazon S3 and Amazon DynamoDB are AWS services called at
runtime under the AWS Service Terms. Their outputs and the terms that cover them are recorded in
`DATA-SOURCES.md`.
